[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m Let's denote the vertices of the octahedron as \(A, B, C, D, E, F\). Assume the octahedron is centered at the origin \((0,0,0)\) with vertices at \((\pm 1, 0, 0)\), \((0, \pm 1, 0)\), and \((0, 0, \pm 1)\).
