[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m An eight-sided die has faces numbered from 1 to 8. The expected value \(E\) of a single roll is the average of all possible outcomes. This can be calculated as follows:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[E = \frac{1 + 2 + 3 + 4 + 5 + 6 + 7 + 8}{8}\]
