[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m For Sphere:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ \text{Population of Sphere at 8 p.m.} = 8 \times 4^t \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m Since the populations are equal at 8 p.m., we can set the two expressions equal to each other:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ 2 \times 2^{t+5} = 8 \times 4^t \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m Simplify the equation:
