[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ 2 \times 2^{t+5} = 8 \times (2^2)^t \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ 2 \times 2^{t+5} = 8 \times 2^{2t} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ 2 \times 2^{t+5} = 2^3 \times 2^{2t} \]
