[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m Let's denote the number of hours since Jane started growing Sphere as \( t \). Since Jane started growing Rod 5 hours before Sphere, the number of hours since Jane started growing Rod would be \( t + 5 \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m Given:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m - The population of Rod doubles every hour.
