[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m - The starting population of Rod is 2 bacteria.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m - The starting population of Sphere is 8 bacteria.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m At 8 p.m., the populations are equal. We can set up the following equations based on the growth rates:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m For Rod:
