[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m To find the probability that both tickets win, we multiply the probability of the first ticket winning by the probability of the second ticket winning:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
