[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m - Population of Sphere at 8 p.m. = \( 8 \times 4^t \)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m Since the populations are equal at 8 p.m., we can set up the equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ 2 \times 2^{t+5} = 8 \times 4^t \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m Simplifying the equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ 2 \times 2^{t+5} = 8 \times (2^2)^t \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ 2 \times 2^{t+5} = 8 \times 2^{2t} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ 2 \times 2^{t+5} = 2^3 \times 2^{2t} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ 2^{t+6} = 2^{2t+3} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
