[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ V_{\text{cylinder}} = \pi r^2 h \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m where \( r \) is the radius of the cylinder and \( h \) is the height of the cylinder.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m For the cylindrical beaker:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m - \( r = 3 \) cm
