[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ V_{\text{sphere}} = \frac{4}{3} \pi (6)^3 = \frac{4}{3} \pi \cdot 216 = 288\pi \, \text{cm}^3 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
