[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[x^2 - 13x + 22 = 0.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m This is a quadratic equation. We can factor it as follows:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[x^2 - 13x + 22 = (x - 2)(x - 11) = 0.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
