[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m - \( r = 0.10 \) (10% annual interest rate)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m - \( n = 4 \) (since the interest is compounded quarterly)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m - \( t = 5 \) years
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m Substituting these values into the formula:
