[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[2 \times 2^{x+5} = 8 \times 4^x\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m Simplifying the left side, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
