[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[D^2 = \left(\frac{9}{2}\right) - 9\left(\frac{9}{2}\right) + 25 = \frac{9}{2} - \frac{81}{2} + 25 = \frac{9 - 81 + 50}{2} = -\frac{22}{2} + 25 = 25 - \frac{22}{2} = 25 - 11 = 14\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
