[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ \frac{d}{dt} \left( 3 \sin \frac{t}{4} \right) = 3 \cdot \frac{1}{4} \cos \frac{t}{4} = \frac{3}{4} \cos \frac{t}{4} \]
