[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m Calculating the value:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ H_0 = \frac{452}{1.9799328985} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ H_0 \approx 228.4 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
