[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m [response] To solve this problem, we can use the tangent addition formula and the Law of Sines. First, we note that $\tan A = -\tan(B+C)$ due to the tangent addition formula and the fact that $A + B + C = \pi$ in a triangle. We have:
