[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m First, let's compute $f(g(x))$ and $g(f(x))$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 1. $f(g(x)) = f\left(\frac{-2}{x+1}\right) = \frac{1 + \frac{-2}{x+1}}{1 - \frac{-2}{x+1}} = \frac{\frac{x+1-2}{x+1}}{\frac{x+1+2}{x+1}} = \frac{x-1}{x+3}$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 2. $g(f(x)) = g\left(\frac{1+x}{1-x}\right) = \frac{-2}{\frac{1+x}{1-x} + 1} = \frac{-2}{\frac{1+x+1-x}{1-x}} = \frac{-2}{\frac{2}{1-x}} = -(1-x) = x-1$.
