[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m The area of a trapezoid is given by $\frac{1}{2} \times ( \text{sum of parallel sides} ) \times \text{height}$. Therefore, the area of $ABEF$ is $\frac{1}{2} \times (a + \frac{a+b}{2}) \times h = \frac{1}{2} \times \frac{3a+b}{2} \times h = \frac{(3a+b)h}{4}$.
