[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m The least common multiple (LCM) of $a$ and $b$ is given by $\frac{a \times b}{\text{gcd}(a,b)} = \frac{6 \times 24}{6} = 24$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
