[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m assistant
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m [response] To solve the equation \(\sqrt{5 | x | + 8} = \sqrt{x^2 - 16}\), we first square both sides to eliminate the square roots:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[5 | x | + 8 = x^2 - 16.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m Rearranging gives:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[x^2 - 5 | x | - 24 = 0.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m We need to consider two cases for \(|x|\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 1. When \(x \geq 0\), \(|x| = x\), so the equation becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[x^2 - 5x - 24 = 0.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m Factoring this quadratic equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[(x - 8)(x + 3) = 0.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m So, \(x = 8\) or \(x = -3\). Since we are considering \(x \geq 0\), we only take \(x = 8\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 2. When \(x < 0\), \(|x| = -x\), so the equation becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[x^2 + 5x - 24 = 0.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m Factoring this quadratic equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[(x + 8)(x - 3) = 0.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m So, \(x = -8\) or \(x = 3\). Since we are considering \(x < 0\), we only take \(x = -8\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m Thus, the roots are \(8, -8\). The product of these roots is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[8 \times (-8) = -64.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m Therefore, the final answer is \(\boxed{-64}\).
