[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m a + b + c + d &= 8 - e, \\
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m a^2 + b^2 + c^2 + d^2 &= 16 - e^2.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m By the Cauchy-Schwarz inequality, we know that:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m (a^2 + b^2 + c^2 + d^2)(1^2 + 1^2 + 1^2 + 1^2) \geq (a + b + c + d)^2.
