[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m Simplifying:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[
