[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m By the tangent addition formula or by constructing the triangle's height from $A$ to $BC$, we can derive the sides. But a simpler approach involves the area formula using tangents:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
