[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[f(g(x)) = f\left(\frac{-2}{x+1}\right) = \frac{1 + \frac{-2}{x+1}}{1 - \frac{-2}{x+1}} = \frac{\frac{x+1-2}{x+1}}{\frac{x+1+2}{x+1}} = \frac{x-1}{x+3}.\]
