[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[5 | x | + 8 = x^2 - 16.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m Rearranging gives:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[x^2 - 5 | x | - 24 = 0.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m We need to consider two cases for \(|x|\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
