[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 2. When \(x < 0\), \(|x| = -x\), so the equation becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[x^2 + 5x - 24 = 0.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
