[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m Given that $\text{Area}_{ABEF} = 2 \times \text{Area}_{FECD}$:
