[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ r_1 + r_2 + r_3 + r_4 = \frac{a}{4}. \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m We are given:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ \frac{r_1}{2} + \frac{r_2}{4} + \frac{r_3}{5} + \frac{r_4}{8} = 1. \]
