[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \text{Area} = \frac{1}{2} \cdot AB \cdot AC \cdot \sin A = \frac{1}{2} \cdot 8\sqrt{5} \cdot 4\sqrt{13} \cdot \frac{8}{\sqrt{65}} = 96
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
