[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m Given distances are 3, 7, 8, 9, 11. Let the unknown distance be $x$. Then,
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[3^2 + 7^2 + 8^2 + 9^2 + 11^2 + x^2 = k\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m where $k$ is a constant. We can calculate:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[9 + 49 + 64 + 81 + 121 + x^2 = k\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[324 + x^2 = k\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
