[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m Using the formula for the area of a triangle:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \text{Area} = \frac{1}{2} \cdot a \cdot b \cdot \sin C
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m We can use:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \sin B = \frac{3}{\sqrt{13}}, \quad \sin C = \frac{1}{\sqrt{5}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \]
