[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m [response] Given that the units digit of \(a\) is 2 and the units digit of \(b\) is 4, and the greatest common divisor (gcd) of \(a\) and \(b\) is 6, we can express \(a\) and \(b\) as:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ a = 6m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ b = 6n \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m where \(m\) and \(n\) are coprime integers (i.e., \(\gcd(m, n) = 1\)).
