[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ m_b = 150 \text{ g} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m We can solve for the ratio \( \frac{a_s}{a_b} \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ 200 a_s = 150 a_b \]
