[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m So, the prime factorization of 720 is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ 720 = 2^4 \times 3^2 \times 5 \]
