[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m Since \( y = x^2 - 5 \), we substitute \( y \) in the distance formula:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m D = \sqrt{x^2 + (x^2 - 5)^2}
