[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m The speed \( v \) of the particle is the magnitude of the velocity vector:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ v = \sqrt{\left( \frac{dx}{dt} \right)^2 + \left( \frac{dy}{dt} \right)^2} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1466195)[0m \[ v = \sqrt{\left( \frac{3}{4} \cos \frac{t}{4} \right)^2 + \left( -\frac{3}{4} \sin \frac{t}{4} \right)^2} \]
